2. Added imports for necessary TRPC and React Query dependencies
3. Set up the TRPC client with proper configuration
4. Wrapped the component with both TRPC Provider and QueryClientProvider
5. Used the correct provider setup with proper client configuration

This should resolve the error by properly setting up the TRPC provider with the necessary configuration. The component should now be able to make TRPC calls correctly.

